' Singleton-diamond fixture — stateless library object (library_object
' archetype: no VAR, no init, pure functions) AND the exportdef gate.
'
' Two jobs, deliberately kept on this file so the other properties stay
' independently mutable:
'
'  1. Second child of sgl_svc_logger, so that object is a genuine two-child
'     node and a test can mutate one child without touching the other.
'
'  2. THE EXPORTDEF REGRESSION GUARD. This file's bytes depend on SGL_TRACE,
'     which is defined nowhere in this file — sgl_app_top exports it with
'     #pragma exportdef and it reaches here through the preprocessor. Nothing
'     between here and the top mentions SGL_TRACE, so the symbol has to
'     survive the whole descent.
'
'     That is the v1.54.6 failure mode: when an ancestor cache-hits, its
'     subtree's preprocess is skipped, the exportdef push never happens, and
'     THIS file compiles down a different branch than a cold compile would.
'     If a future change to the cache breaks subtree-export replay, the byte
'     comparison in the invalidation suite catches it here.
PUB width(value) : digits
  digits := 1
  repeat while value >= 10
    value /= 10
    digits++

#ifdef SGL_TRACE
PUB trace_tag() : tag
  tag := $5347_4C54
#else
PUB trace_tag() : tag
  tag := 0
#endif
